Local changes:
- package-relative imports
- BandSplitWrapperBase subclasses torch.nn.Module instead of
  pytorch_lightning.LightningModule, and forwards constructor arguments
  to the STFT mixin
- musical-scale helpers no longer import librosa
- bark / ERB filterbank imports are lazy, so the BandIt Plus
  (musical, 64-band) checkpoint does not require spafe
